sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor UI as UI Component
    participant Hook as useQuery / useMutation
    participant Client as API Client (Fetch Wrapper)
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth Session
    participant Gateway as Phase 05 Edge Gateway

    UI->>Hook: Trigger query/mutation
    Hook->>Client: Call typed endpoint function
    Client->>Auth: Retrieve active RS256 JWT
    Auth-->>Client: Return `access_token`
    Client->>Gateway: HTTPS Request + `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>`
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200/201/202 JSON Envelope
    Client-->>Hook: Return `data` payload
    Hook-->>UI: Re-render with fresh server state
